  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A very common problem for me, mostly because I am a world hopper is that while loading into a world, it will become stuck at 100% then after a while pop back to 0/0% where is often sticks to that number forever. I understand this may be a problem with my cpu, being an old i5 4460. And I understand it probably can’t be fixed. But what I’m asking is that after I get stuck I should ATLEAST be able to go home instead of having to RESTART my whole game! It’s very annoying having to close and reopen my game after joining 3-4 worlds. I’ve seen this happen to drumsy on stream, this has happened to my friends, it happens to me, ect. Please fix!",
